<% } %>
<% if (modules.web) { %>
- **Token storage (web):** httpOnly cookie or in-memory only -- **never** `localStorage`
<% } %>
- **XSS:** No unescaped user input rendered as HTML or in dangerous render methods
- **Deep linking:** Routes accessible via deep link must enforce authentication if protected
- **Production logs:** No `console.log`/`print` exposing tokens, passwords, PII, or sensitive data in production builds
<% if (modules.mobile) { %>
- **Certificate pinning:** Configured correctly if applicable (mobile apps)
<% } %>
<% } %>
